    "chunk_text": "\u00f0e for\u00fefered, & he \u00fea sona w\u00e6s geboren to byrgenne & \u00fea eode lig ut of his byrgene swi\u00fee lange hwile, swa ealle \u00fea gesawon, \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6r neh w\u00e6ron, & Witodlice \u00fe\u00e6t dyde se \u00e6lmihtiga drihten, to \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t he gecy\u00fede, hw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s sawl \u00ferowode on In \u00fe\u00e6re wisan, Petrus, God sylfa w\u00e6s geeadmodod, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde us, \u00fee \u00feis gehyrdon, \u00fea Petrus cw\u00e6\u00f0: ic wolde witan, hwe\u00feer \u00fea godan men ongytan \u00fea godan in heofona rice, o\u00fe\u00fee \u00fea Gregorius him andswarode: se cwide is gecy\u00feed swi\u00f0e swutellice \u00feyssere wisan in \u00feam & \u00fea w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6r eac sum w\u00e6dla, \u00fe\u00e6s nama w\u00e6s Lazarus, se l\u00e6g \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s welegan mannes dura Ac \u00fea hundas comon to him & liccedan his wunda. Eac hit is ges\u00e6d on \u00feam godspelle, \u00fe\u00e6t Lazarus dead w\u00e6s, & \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s boren fram Godes & \u00fea \u00fea he w\u00e6s in \u00feam tintregum, he hof his eagan upp. \u00dea geseah he Abraham feorran & Lazarum \u00feone \u00feearfan on his bearme. & he \u00fea se welega clypiende \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0: f\u00e6der Abraham, gemiltsa me & ons\u00e6nd Lazarum, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Abraham to him: gemuna la, sunu, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu onfenge micclum gode on \u00feinum life on \u00dea ong\u00e6t se w\u00e6liga, \u00fe\u00e6t he ne \u00feorfte na ofer \u00fe\u00e6t wenan him selfum \u00fe\u00e6re ecan h\u00e6le hihtes. Ac he",
